      "name": "[Evelyn] Lethal Etiquette - Lv.50",
      "desc": "Evelyn's exclusive Tactical Prism.\nAfter using Phase Dash, Evelyn recovers 1 Burning Tether Point.\nWhen any squad member's <color=#FFFFFF>Aftershock</color>, <color=#FFFFFF>Quick Assist</color>, or <color=#FFFFFF>Perfect Assist</color> hits enemies, Evelyn restores <color=#FFFFFF>Burning Embers</color>. When Evelyn consumes <color=#FFFFFF>Burning Tether Points</color> to activate <color=#FFFFFF>Chain Attack: Lunalux - Snare</color>, it will be replaced by <color=#FFFFFF>Chain Attack: Lunalux - Entanglement</color>, significantly reducing skill duration. When Evelyn's <color=#FFFFFF>Chain Attack</color> hits enemies, <color=#2BAD00>the skill's DMG increases by 80%</color>.",
